msgid "Keeps WooCommerce EU tax rates up to date from the European Commission TEDB, and validates customer VAT numbers against VIES to apply the reverse charge."
msgstr "Iżomm ir-rati tal-VAT tal-UE f'WooCommerce aġġornati mid-database TEDB tal-Kummissjoni Ewropea u jivverifika n-numri tal-VAT tal-klijenti permezz ta' VIES biex tiġi applikata l-inverżjoni tal-ħlas."

msgid "EU VAT Rates"
msgstr "Rati tal-VAT tal-UE"

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Issettjar"

msgid "Get an API key"
msgstr "Ikseb ċavetta API"

msgid "Insufficient permissions."
msgstr "Permessi insuffiċjenti."

msgid "EU VAT Rates and VIES Validation"
msgstr "Rati tal-VAT tal-UE u verifika VIES"

msgid "EU VAT rates synced successfully."
msgstr "Ir-rati tal-VAT tal-UE ġew sinkronizzati."

msgid "Sync failed."
msgstr "Is-sinkronizzazzjoni falliet."

msgid "Settings saved."
msgstr "L-issettjar ġie salvat."

msgid "API key accepted by vatnode."
msgstr "Iċ-ċavetta API ġiet aċċettata minn vatnode."

msgid "API key check failed."
msgstr "Il-verifika taċ-ċavetta API falliet."

msgid "Sell to EU businesses without VAT"
msgstr "Biegħ lil negozji fl-UE mingħajr VAT"

msgid "Add a vatnode API key and the plugin checks customer VAT numbers against the official VIES service at checkout. Verified EU business buyers outside your country are charged no VAT, and the evidence is stored on the order."
msgstr "Żid ċavetta API ta' vatnode u l-plugin jivverifika n-numru tal-VAT tal-klijent mas-servizz uffiċjali VIES waqt il-ħlas. Ix-xerrejja kummerċjali verifikati minn pajjiżi oħra tal-UE ma jitħallsux VAT, u l-prova tinżamm mal-ordni."

msgid "Already have a vatnode account? %s and paste it below."
msgstr "Diġà għandek kont vatnode? %s u waħħalha hawn taħt."

msgid "Create a key"
msgstr "Oħloq ċavetta"

msgid "Get an API Key"
msgstr "Ikseb ċavetta API"

msgid "VAT number validation"
msgstr "Verifika tan-numru tal-VAT"

msgid "vatnode API key"
msgstr "Ċavetta API ta' vatnode"

msgid "A key is stored. Leave this empty to keep it, or paste a new one to replace it."
msgstr "Hemm ċavetta salvata. Ħalli l-kaxxa vojta biex iżżommha, jew waħħal waħda ġdida biex tissostitwixxiha."

msgid "Create a key in your %s dashboard. The free plan includes a monthly request quota."
msgstr "Oħloq ċavetta fid-dashboard %s. Il-pjan bla ħlas jinkludi kwota mensili ta' talbiet."

msgid "Key status:"
msgstr "Stat taċ-ċavetta:"

msgid "Working"
msgstr "Taħdem"

msgid "Rejected by vatnode"
msgstr "Miċħuda minn vatnode"

msgid "Monthly quota exceeded"
msgstr "Il-kwota mensili nqabżet"

msgid "Could not reach vatnode"
msgstr "vatnode ma setax jintlaħaq"

msgid "Last call failed"
msgstr "L-aħħar sejħa falliet"

msgid "Not checked yet"
msgstr "Għadha ma ġietx ivverifikata"

msgid "Checkout"
msgstr "Ħlas"

msgid "Verify VAT numbers with VIES and apply the reverse charge"
msgstr "Ivverifika n-numri tal-VAT permezz ta' VIES u applika l-inverżjoni tal-ħlas"

msgid "The VAT number field is always shown at checkout. Without a key the number is only format-checked and stored — VAT is still charged."
msgstr "Il-kaxxa tan-numru tal-VAT tidher dejjem waqt il-ħlas. Mingħajr ċavetta, in-numru jiġi ċċekkjat biss għall-format u jinżamm — il-VAT xorta tintalab."

msgid "Make the VAT number field required"
msgstr "Agħmel il-kaxxa tan-numru tal-VAT obbligatorja"

msgid "Only for B2B-only stores — consumers do not have a VAT number."
msgstr "Għal ħwienet li jbigħu lil negozji biss — il-konsumaturi m'għandhomx numru tal-VAT."

msgid "Which rate applies"
msgstr "Liema rata tapplika"

msgid "This store is registered for the EU One Stop Shop (OSS)"
msgstr "Dan il-ħanut huwa rreġistrat mal-One Stop Shop tal-UE (OSS)"

msgid "Registered: consumers in other EU countries are charged the rate of their own country. Not registered: every EU buyer is charged the %s rate, which is what applies while your cross-border sales stay under the EU-wide 10,000 EUR threshold."
msgstr "Irreġistrat: il-konsumaturi f'pajjiżi oħra tal-UE jitħallsu r-rata ta' pajjiżhom stess. Mhux irreġistrat: kull xerrej tal-UE jitħallas ir-rata ta' %s, li tapplika sakemm il-bejgħ transkonfinali tiegħek jibqa' taħt il-limitu ta' 10,000 EUR għall-UE kollha."

msgid "Save Settings"
msgstr "Salva l-issettjar"

msgid "Remove key"
msgstr "Neħħi ċ-ċavetta"

msgid "Test Key"
msgstr "Ittestja ċ-ċavetta"

msgid "Reverse charge is active for verified EU business buyers outside your country."
msgstr "L-inverżjoni tal-ħlas hija attiva għal negozji tal-UE verifikati barra pajjiżek."

msgid "Rate sync"
msgstr "Sinkronizzazzjoni tar-rati"

msgid "Auto-sync"
msgstr "Sinkronizzazzjoni awtomatika"

msgid "Active — daily"
msgstr "Attiva — kuljum"

msgid "Last sync"
msgstr "L-aħħar sinkronizzazzjoni"

msgid "Never"
msgstr "Qatt"

msgid "Data version"
msgstr "Verżjoni tad-data"

msgid "Next auto-sync"
msgstr "Is-sinkronizzazzjoni awtomatika li jmiss"

msgid "Source"
msgstr "Sors"

msgid "(European Commission TEDB)"
msgstr "(TEDB tal-Kummissjoni Ewropea)"

msgid "Sync Now"
msgstr "Sinkronizza issa"

msgid "Current rates (%d countries)"
msgstr "Rati attwali (%d pajjiżi)"

msgid "Country"
msgstr "Pajjiż"

msgid "Code"
msgstr "Kodiċi"

msgid "Standard"
msgstr "Standard"

msgid "Reduced"
msgstr "Imnaqqsa"

msgid "Super-reduced"
msgstr "Imnaqqsa ħafna"

msgid "Parking"
msgstr "Tranżitorja"

msgid "No vatnode API key configured."
msgstr "L-ebda ċavetta API ta' vatnode mhi kkonfigurata."

msgid "vatnode API returned HTTP %d."
msgstr "L-API ta' vatnode irritorna HTTP %d."

msgid "Enter an API key first."
msgstr "L-ewwel daħħal ċavetta API."

msgid "API key was rejected by vatnode."
msgstr "Iċ-ċavetta API ġiet miċħuda minn vatnode."

msgid "VAT number"
msgstr "Numru tal-VAT"

msgid "Please enter your VAT number."
msgstr "Jekk jogħġbok daħħal in-numru tal-VAT tiegħek."

msgid "e.g. DE123456789"
msgstr "eż. DE123456789"

msgid "EU businesses outside our country: enter your VAT number to buy without VAT."
msgstr "Negozji tal-UE barra pajjiżna: daħħal in-numru tal-VAT tiegħek biex tixtri mingħajr VAT."

msgid "VAT number %1$s — %2$s"
msgstr "Numru tal-VAT %1$s — %2$s"

msgid "EU VAT"
msgstr "VAT tal-UE"

msgid "VAT number:"
msgstr "Numru tal-VAT:"

msgid "Status:"
msgstr "Stat:"

msgid "Reverse charge:"
msgstr "Inverżjoni tal-ħlas:"

msgid "Applied"
msgstr "Applikata"

msgid "Not applied"
msgstr "Mhux applikata"

msgid "Registered name:"
msgstr "Isem irreġistrat:"

msgid "VIES consultation number:"
msgstr "Numru ta' konsultazzjoni VIES:"

msgid "Checked:"
msgstr "Ivverifikat:"

msgid "Not scheduled"
msgstr "Mhux skedata"

msgid "VAT number could not be verified — VAT charged as usual."
msgstr "In-numru tal-VAT ma setax jiġi vverifikat — il-VAT intalbet bħas-soltu."

msgid "Reverse charge applies only to stores based in the EU."
msgstr "L-inverżjoni tal-ħlas tapplika biss għal ħwienet stabbiliti fl-UE."

msgid "This does not look like a valid EU VAT number. Check it, or leave the field empty."
msgstr "Dan ma jidhirx numru tal-VAT validu tal-UE. Iċċekkjah, jew ħalli l-kaxxa vojta."

msgid "The VAT number is registered in %1$s but the billing address is in %2$s. They must match."
msgstr "In-numru tal-VAT huwa rreġistrat f'%1$s imma l-indirizz tal-kont huwa f'%2$s. Iridu jaqblu."

msgid "Domestic sale — VAT is charged as usual."
msgstr "Bejgħ domestiku — il-VAT tintalab bħas-soltu."

msgid "This VAT number is not registered in VIES. Check it, or leave the field empty to pay VAT."
msgstr "Dan in-numru tal-VAT mhuwiex irreġistrat f'VIES. Iċċekkjah, jew ħalli l-kaxxa vojta biex tħallas il-VAT."

msgid "VAT number verified — reverse charge applies."
msgstr "In-numru tal-VAT ġie vverifikat — tapplika l-inverżjoni tal-ħlas."

msgid "Verified — reverse charge applied"
msgstr "Ivverifikat — inverżjoni tal-ħlas applikata"

msgid "Not registered in VIES"
msgstr "Mhux irreġistrat f'VIES"

msgid "Invalid format"
msgstr "Format invalidu"

msgid "VAT country does not match billing country"
msgstr "Il-pajjiż tan-numru tal-VAT ma jaqbilx mal-pajjiż tal-kont"

msgid "Domestic sale — VAT charged"
msgstr "Bejgħ domestiku — VAT mitluba"

msgid "Outside the EU VAT area"
msgstr "Barra t-territorju tal-VAT tal-UE"

msgid "Not verified — VAT charged"
msgstr "Mhux ivverifikat — VAT mitluba"

msgid "No VAT number provided"
msgstr "L-ebda numru tal-VAT ma ngħata"

msgid "requires WooCommerce to be active."
msgstr "jeħtieġ li WooCommerce ikun attiv."
